@SmartMenuOptim.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7119

### Get all sale records (using URL versioning)
GET {{SmartMenuOptim.API_HostAddress}}/api/SaleRecords
Accept: application/json

### Get all sale records (using header versioning)
GET {{SmartMenuOptim.API_HostAddress}}/api/SaleRecords
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Version: 1.0

### Get specific sale record
GET {{SmartMenuOptim.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/SaleRecords/1
Accept: application/json

### Create new sale record
POST {{SmartMenuOptim.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/SaleRecords
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "dishId": 1,
    "quantitySold": 5,
    "saleDate": "2024-01-21T10:00:00Z"
}

### 

GET {{SmartMenuOptim.API_HostAddress}}/api/salerecords

